      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description: First person view walking along a rain-soaked container port at night. Black tactical gloves at the bottom of frame, amber floodlights on wet steel. The camera moves forward steadily and comes to a stop.\n\noverall_soundscape: Rain hitting steel, boots on wet concrete, a distant harbour horn.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Low industrial drone, slow pulse.\n\n---\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: The same port, same gloves. A steel container door swings open ahead, harsh white light spilling across the wet ground. The camera walks toward it.\n\noverall_soundscape: Rain, a heavy steel door groaning open, voices echoing inside.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: The drone tightens, a low pulse building.",
